  "$note": "ttgir_patterns match Triton cache .ttgir MLIR (tt./ttg./amdg. ops). isa_patterns match the isa layer in isa_check.py: .amdgcn cache assembly plus dccobjdump output on hsaco. Do not use llir_patterns, llir_check_optional, llvm.hcu.*, or MLIR ops in isa_patterns.",
